[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780962292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-2780962292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":2780962292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lwh30","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T17:03:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T17:03:48Z","body":"Some backwards-compatibility system should probably be backported to 4.4 (maybe 4.3 also?) for reading disk-compressed textures, or at least throwing an error when encountering one. Currently, many compressed textures load properly, but are visually corrupted due to using the raw data","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780962292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4628355706","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4628355706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4628355706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE98aeg","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T04:58:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T05:18:16Z","body":"Rebased (without Basis Universal as it now has a separate Zstd supercompression option) and tested this exporting the TPS demo (Zstd compression level 19, the maximum considered non-ultra):\r\n\r\n- `master` (PCK): 538.5 MiB\r\n- `master` (ZIP): 246.4 MiB\r\n- Rebased PR (PCK): 300.2 MiB\r\n- Rebased PR (ZIP): 228.6 MiB\r\n\r\nOne note I might add is that for some reason, the changes throw an error when trying to import .exr files, even if we're not importing as `VRAM Compressed` or `VRAM Uncompressed`. The latter tests were done by reimporting every PNG file in the project instead of deleting `.godot/`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4628355706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632589249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4632589249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4632589249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFB-zwQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T14:23:41Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T14:23:41Z","body":"@DeeJayLSP Do you have your rebased branch available somewhere so I can incorporate it in this PR? I'll make sure to add you as a co-author.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632589249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632625431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4632625431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4632625431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFCBBFw","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T14:28:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T14:29:14Z","body":"This makes sense for the usual case of an independent game developer releasing on itchio.\r\n\r\nThe vast majority of game developers don't make money and release occur rarely.\r\n\r\nIf you're doing a professional release, you probably want guidance to avoid double compression like on the Steam, Apple and Google Play stores.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632625431/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632681299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4632681299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4632681299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFCEbUw","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T14:33:59Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T14:33:17Z","body":"> @DeeJayLSP Do you have your rebased branch available somewhere so I can incorporate it in this PR? I'll make sure to add you as a co-author.\r\n\r\n[Here](https://github.com/DeeJayLSP/godot/tree/zstd-tex).\r\n\r\nNote that I made this just for the purposes of testing and might have a bit of flavor (I changed the project setting) and issues (notably, the error when loading ~~imported .exr files~~ **CORRECTION: any import format handled by `ResourceImporterLayeredTexture`, whatever type you use is fine**).\r\n\r\nIt doesn't apply for Basis Universal, as it currently [integrates Zstd supercompression](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-textures-basis-universal-zstd-supercompression).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632681299/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640038718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4640038718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4640038718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJFfPg","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T18:59:41Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T04:36:57Z","body":"> and therefore faster downloads\r\n\r\n> If you're doing a professional release, you probably want guidance to avoid double compression like on the Steam, Apple and Google Play stores.\r\n\r\nI'd add this helps spare the user's disk space.\r\n\r\nThat's the main reason I'm interested in this PR. It's not everyone that can afford terabytes of storage.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640038718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4662570061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4662570061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4662570061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFeksTQ","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T18:02:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T15:07:19Z","body":"I did another test not inside Godot but manipulating files on GIMP.\r\n\r\nConverted a 1K PBR material (taken from [here](https://ambientcg.com/view?id=Ground037), with albedo, normal and a merged ORD) from PNG to DDS two times, one using DXT5 and one using BC7, then compressed both with `zstd --ultra -22` (the maximum possible level)\r\n\r\nNormally, both formats should take the same space in disk (BC7 takes 20 more bytes than DXT5), but when you apply supercompression (this seems to be the industry standard term for what this PR does), things change a bit:\r\n\r\n(size in bytes)\r\n|Texture|DXT5|BC7|DXT5 + Zstd|BC7 + Zstd|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|Albedo|1048704|1048724|498741|1045971|\r\n|Normal|1048704|1048724|474466|875514|\r\n|ORD|1048704|1048724|424475|918016|\r\n|**Total**|**3146112**|**3146172**|**1397682**|**2839501**|\r\n\r\nLooks like checking High Quality on import has a significant size impact now (still better than no supercompression). I think this should be mentioned.\r\n\r\nSame test but with the 4K variant:\r\n\r\n|Texture|DXT5|BC7|DXT5 + Zstd|BC7 + Zstd|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|Albedo|16777744|16777764|8042626|16777764|\r\n|Normal|16777744|16777764|7900346|16531642|\r\n|ORD|16777744|16777764|6784935|13741704|\r\n|**Total**|**50333232**|**50333292**|**22727907**|**47051110**|\r\n\r\nMust call attention to the Albedo with BC7 + Zstd cases, where little to absolutely zero compression was applied.\r\n\r\nAlthough I still believe non-complex textures should have a significant compression ratio. I had a case where a high-res spritesheet with lots of transparency was reduced to around 7% of its original size in High Quality.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4662570061/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4668934840","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571#issuecomment-4668934840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104571","id":4668934840,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFkpKuA","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T10:04:57Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T10:04:57Z","body":"> Normally, both formats should take the same space in disk (BC7 takes 20 more bytes than DXT5), but when you apply supercompression (this seems to be the industry standard term for what this PR does), things change a bit\r\n\r\nThis is to be expected, each 4x4 DXT5 block is made up of 2 parts: An 8-byte DXT1 color block and an 8-byte BC4 alpha block. Since the textures are opaque, the alpha blocks always consist of the exact same data, which improves the compression ratio. BC7, on the other hand, always makes use of the full 16 bytes per block, so the compression ratio becomes much worse.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4668934840/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]